WEBVTT

NOTE Synthetic demo transcript created for the UniPods Pulse demo.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Amara Obi: Welcome everyone to the hackathon kickoff. We have about forty minutes, and I want to get through the dates, the team rules and the AI track brief.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:41.000
Amara Obi: Starting with dates. Registration is already open. Team declarations are due Thursday, September 17, by close of business, and that is a hard deadline this year.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:01:04.000
Tunde Bello: Can we confirm that is the seventeenth? The earlier draft schedule said the eighteenth, and a few people are working from that version.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:28.000
Amara Obi: Good catch. The seventeenth is correct. The eighteenth in the draft was a typo, and we will post a correction to the announcements channel today so nobody is working from the old date.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:52.000
Amara Obi: The build period runs from the eighteenth to the twenty-third, submissions close at 23:59 on the twenty-third, and demo day is the twenty-fourth.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:02:18.000
Chidi Nwosu: What is the team size limit? Last term it was four and I have five people who want to work together.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:40.000
Amara Obi: It is two to five this year, so a team of five is fine. Solo entries are not accepted. One person, one team.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:03:10.000
Tunde Bello: On the AI track. The brief says entries need to ingest at least two content types and cite sources for every claim. Judges will deliberately ask unanswerable questions.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:36.000
Tunde Bello: So we decided that admitting you do not know scores better than guessing. Hallucinated citations fail the track outright.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:04:02.000
Amara Obi: Right. Action item for me: I will post the corrected deadline and the AI track brief to the announcements channel this afternoon.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:26.000
Chidi Nwosu: I will set up the shared document library so teams have somewhere to put their briefs before Friday.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:48.000
Amara Obi: Mentor office hours run daily from 16:00 to 18:00. Outside those hours use the build-help channel.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:05:06.000
Amara Obi: Anything else? No? Then that is the kickoff. Declarations by the seventeenth, and see you at office hours.
